    "body": "vim.lsp.util already handles WorkspaceEdit.documentChanges and versioned TextDocumentEdits, so advertise that support in the default client capabilities.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nThe default LSP client capabilities omit\r\n`workspace.workspaceEdit.documentChanges`, even though Neovim already\r\nsupports `WorkspaceEdit.documentChanges` and versioned text document edits.\r\nServers that check this capability cannot use that support.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAdvertise `workspace.workspaceEdit.documentChanges` in\r\n`vim.lsp.protocol.make_client_capabilities()`.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-20T14:02:03Z",
    "comment_data": [],
